  m_text: 'Jetstream: a simple directional force (like a wind tunnel in a circular
    radius). Dock Nodes that accept Jetstreams will display an arrow in the direction
    of the stream. A light green arrow is a weaker force, while a dark red arrow
    is a stronger force. These can either have a Guassian falloff or a strict radius
    of effect.'
