  m_text: 'Stabilizer: a gentle Gaussian falloff gravity zone. This field works similar
    to a gravity well, but with a Gaussian "bell-curve" falloff. It is strongest
    at a specific distance away, and falls off to zero towards the center and away
    from its peak range.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
